press+='''<section class="shell section press-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Artist biography</p><h2>MR. BLINDBANDIT</h2><p class="large-copy">Mr. Blindbandit is Kaeleb Heck, an American recording artist, producer, and content creator with Virginia roots and a home in the Philippines.</p><p>Blind since birth, he works with screen readers and accessible technology to create across ambient, cinematic, electronic, and hip-hop sounds. As founder of Blindbandit Records, he brings together independent music, video, and digital storytelling. His catalog includes Sapphire castles, Genesis, weightless, and cry forever, with creative connections including UUu Tang Maskman, Yxngfery, and Pablo Jackson Hairston.</p><a class="button" href="/press/artist-bio.txt" download>Download artist bio ↓</a><h3>For interviews &amp; creative inquiries</h3><p>Contact <a href="mailto:business@mrblindbandit.net">business@mrblindbandit.net</a>. Include your outlet or project, intended use, and timeline. For image permissions or additional press materials, please get in touch.</p></div><aside><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><dl><dt>Artist</dt><dd>Mr. Blindbandit</dd><dt>Name</dt><dd>Kaeleb Heck</dd><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Philippines</dd><dt>Roots</dt><dd>Virginia, USA</dd><dt>Label</dt><dd>Blindbandit Records</dd><dt>Creative work</dt><dd>Music, production, video, digital storytelling</dd></dl><a class="text-link" href="/music/">Explore the music ↗</a></aside></section>'''
